 "notes": "Access: free, no login/VIN. The manuals page (Year/Make/Model selector web component gma-cs-mmy-selector) queries GM's public content-search XHR https://contentdelivery.ext.gm.com/bypass/gma-search-api/searchapi/solr/gma-public/select (params fq=locale:en_US, fq=channel:*MANUALS*, fq=file_type:application/pdf, q=+YEAR +MAKE +MODEL); model list from .../solr/make-model-year/select (region GMNA, country US). Every document URL below is the 'path' returned by that API for the US/en_US index and is hosted on GM's asset host contentdelivery.ext.gm.com (/content/dam/cope/en_us/public/pdf_assets/active/...). Verified 2026-10-02 with GET Range bytes=0-1023: all returned HTTP 206, body starts with %PDF, Content-Type application/pdf; size_bytes from Content-Range. US edition: English US index (locale en_US); 2017+ file names carry en_US and the _U_ (US) market marker. GM's English owner manuals are generally single editions for US and Canada (English); French-Canadian editions are not in this index and are not included. Maintenance schedules are a chapter of each owner manual; GM publishes no separate maintenance booklet for these lines. doc_type warranty_maintenance = GM brand-wide 'Limited Warranty and Owner Assistance Information' booklet for that model year (same URL repeats across lines). Deliberately excluded although present in the index: infotainment manuals, Spanish (es_US) 'Manual del Propietario' editions (2023 only), the multi-year 'California Warranty Information for 2018-2025 GM Owner's Manuals' insert, and EV models (Equinox EV, Escalade IQ/IQL). Cadillac specifics: CTS 2014 has two owner manuals (new third-generation CTS sedan, and the carry-over 'CTS and CTS-V' coupe/wagon edition); 2015 has a separate CTS-V owner manual; 2016-2019 CTS and CTS-V share one manual. Escalade ESV: GM publishes no separate ESV manual; the Escalade manual covers ESV (titles name ESV explicitly for 2014 and 2022-2026). Escalade 2021-2024 3.0L Duramax diesel owner-manual supplements, Super Cruise trailering upgrades, the MY2022-2023 Park Assist/Reverse Automatic Braking insert, the 2026 trailer-towing supplement, 2025 EOSI and 2026 VRI booklets (VRI bilingual en_US/fr_CA), and the 2024 Super Cruise / 2025 V-Series personalization guides are listed as doc_type other. Cadillac quick_reference = 'Convenience and Personalization Guide'.",
